 ```
 
+Pass `allowMultiple: true` to preserve duplicate cookie values in order. Names that
+appear once stay strings. By default, only the first value is kept.
+
+```ts
+parse("foo=a;bar=bar;foo=b;foo=c", { allowMultiple: true });
+// => { foo: ["a", "b", "c"], bar: "bar" }
+```
